{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "jdy31",
  "title": "JDY-31A V2.241 (SPP + BLE)",
  "baud": 9600,
  "ending": "CRLF",
  "timeout_ms": 800,
  "verified_reads": true,
  "notes": "PHYSICALLY VERIFIED on JDY-31A-V2.241 (2026-10-15): Classic 3.0 + BLE, UART 9600 8N1 CRLF. Five read queries (VERSION, LADDR, NAME, BAUD, PIN) returned values. AT+NAME returned +NAME=JDY-31 after operator renamed the device; an earlier +NAME=? coincided with the name shown on the phone. The origin of '?' is UNKNOWN; no evidence that AT+NAME caused it. Eleven [PROBE] commands from related-module documentation remain unverified and excluded from automatic reads, snapshots, and inspection. All writes/reset disabled. Breakout VCC 3.6-6V, UART 3.3V.",
  "reference": "https://fccid.io/2AXM8-JDY-33/User-Manual/15-JDY-33-UserMan-US-r2-4936883.pdf",
  "queries": [
    {
      "id": "version",
